==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Secret Crush Cat (Special Cat)|Secret Crush Cat]], [[Tomboy Lion Cat (Special Cat)|Tomboy Lion Cat]], [[Chalkboard Eraser Cat (Special Cat)|Chalkboard Eraser Cat]], [[Class Rep Cat (Special Cat)|Class Rep Cat]], [[Principal Cat (Special Cat)|Principal Cat]] and [[Occultist Cat (Special Cat)|Occultist Cat]]

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Confessional Tree (Enemy Base)|Confessional Tree]].
*1 [[White Wind]] spawns.
*1 [[White Wind]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[White Wind]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (300%) spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (300%) spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (300%) spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Red Wind]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[White Wind]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Red Wind]]s (300%) spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam any of the [[Heartbeat Catcademy (Event Gacha)|Heartbeat Catcademy]] Units to win, and add a [[Cat Combo]] if you need it.

